CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785439188
OL,3,CDrought status declared for all of
OL,4,CWales as July set to be driest ever
OL,6,FRhian Thomas, Sustainable Water and
OL,7,FNature Manager at Natural Resources
OL,8,FWales, said: "The intensity of the
OL,9,Fheat and the exceptional lack of
OL,10,Frainfall means this is a rapidly
OL,11,Fchanging picture in Wales.
OL,13,F"Our teams are closely monitoring
OL,14,Fforecasts and river flows and
OL,15,Fresponding to increasing environmental
OL,16,Fconcerns and incidents across Wales.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
