FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785439188
OL,3,CDrought status declared for all of
OL,4,CWales as July set to be driest ever
OL,6,F"The toll on the environment, our land
OL,7,Fand agriculture is clear to see, with
OL,8,Fmany of our teams still dealing with
OL,9,Fthe aftermath of extensive wildfires
OL,10,Fwhich have devastated forestry,
OL,11,Fgrassland and special habitats.
OL,13,F"With no strong indications for
OL,14,Fnotable rainfall in the forecasts, and
OL,15,Frisks of further heatwaves over the
OL,16,Fsummer, it's more important than ever
OL,17,Fthat we all use water wisely. Every
OL,18,Fdrop we waste is less water for our
OL,19,Frivers and wildlife when they need it
OL,20,Fthe most."
